teclado/ring via FlocksInteraction.\"\n    },\n    \"crossPlatform\": true,\n    \"themeAware\": true,\n    \"reducesMotion\": true,\n    \"related\": [\n      \"app_switch\",\n      \"app_radio\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"app_switch\",\n    \"name\": \"AppSwitch\",\n    \"category\": \"atom\",\n    \"status\": \"migrated\",\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"en\": \"On/off switch for a single option.\",\n      \"pt\": \"Switch liga/desliga de uma única opção.\"\n    },\n    \"description\": {\n      \"en\": \"Rebuilt on FlocksInteraction (focus/keyboard/hover/ring); the thumb animation runs through AppMotion (honors reduce-motion).\",\n      \"pt\": \"Reconstruído sobre FlocksInteraction (foco/teclado/hover/ring); a animação do thumb passa por AppMotion (respeita reduce-motion).\"\n    },\n    \"whenToUse\": {\n      \"en\": [\n        \"Turning a setting on or off immediately.\"\n      ],\n      \"pt\": [\n        \"Ligar/desligar imediatamente uma configuração.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"whenNotToUse\": {\n      \"en\": [\n        \"When confirmation is needed → use a button; for multiple selection → AppCheckbox.\"\n      ],\n      \"pt\": [\n        \"Confirmação necessária → use botão; múltipla → AppCheckbox.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"props\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"value\",\n        \"type\": \"bool\",\n        \"required\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"onChanged\",\n        \"type\": \"ValueChanged<bool>?\",\n        \"required\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"enabled\",\n        \"type\": \"bool\",\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"default\": \"true\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"semanticLabel\",\n        \"type\": \"String?\",\n        \"required\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"tooltip\",\n        \"type\": \"String?\",\n        \"required\": false\n      }\n    ],\n    \"states\": [\n      \"on\",\n      \"off\",\n      \"disabled\",\n      \"focused\",\n      \"hovered\"\n    ],\n    \"examples\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": {\n          \"en\": \"Basic\",\n          \"pt\": \"Básico\"\n        },\n        \"code\": \"AppSwitch(value: on, onChanged: set)\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"do\": {\n      \"en\": [\n        \"Apply the effect immediately on toggle.\"\n      ],\n      \"pt\": [\n        \"Aplique o efeito imediatamente ao alternar.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"dont\": {\n      \"en\": [\n        \"Do not use it for actions that require confirmation.\"\n      ],\n      \"pt\": [\n        \"Não use para ações que exigem confirmação.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"a11y\": {\n      \"en\": \"AppSemantics.toggle exposes toggled/enabled; focus/keyboard via FlocksInteraction.\",\n      \"pt\": \"AppSemantics.toggle expõe toggled/enabled; foco/teclado via FlocksInteraction.\"\n    },\n    \"crossPlatform\": true,\n    \"themeAware\": true,\n    \"reducesMotion\": true,\n    \"related\": [\n      \"app_checkbox\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"app_dots_indicator\",\n    \"name\": \"AppDotsIndicator\",\n    \"category\": \"atom\",\n    \"status\": \"migrated\",\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"en\": \"Progress indicator as dots (current position among N pages).\",\n      \"pt\": \"Indicador de progresso em \\\"dots\\\" (posição atual entre N páginas).\"\n    },\n    \"description\": {\n      \"en\": \"A row of circles where the current step takes the accent color. For labelled steps with a title/icon, use AppStepper.\",\n      \"pt\": \"Fileira de círculos onde o passo atual recebe a cor de destaque. Para etapas rotuladas com título/ícone, use AppStepper.\"\n    },\n    \"whenToUse\": {\n      \"en\": [\n        \"Carousels and onboarding: the current position among a few pages.\"\n      ],\n      \"pt\": [\n        \"Carrosséis/onboarding: posição atual entre poucas páginas.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"whenNotToUse\": {\n      \"en\": [\n        \"Steps with a label or title → AppStepper.\"\n      ],\n      \"pt\": [\n        \"Etapas com rótulo/título →